{"4617970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MugiPunch", "steam_appid": 4617970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/6e1b8fcc60b508de2c44d212f6b35d47.poster.avif?t=1778072269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/6e1b8fcc60b508de2c44d212f6b35d47.webm?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/6e1b8fcc60b508de2c44d212f6b35d47.mp4?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MugiPunch</strong> is a 2D fast-paced <strong>beat 'em up</strong> where you keep punching <strong>enemies</strong> while precisely defending yourself. Mindlessly attacking <strong>them</strong> will only result in defeat. <strong>Observing enemy patterns, then parrying or dodging reactively, is</strong> crucial to stay alive. Unlock new abilities and build your own fighting style as Mugi fight<strong>s</strong> her way to get her lucky SSR drop back!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Juicy</strong>, responsive combat with tons of combo potential</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute</strong> anime-style characters and vibrant stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New</strong> <strong>abilities</strong> that change how you play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Punch them and don't get punch!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be many enemies and obstacle along the way. Mugi’s insane reflexes let her dodge, parry, and counter every situation—no matter how chaotic things get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/f8b0ed7107784442a5ecd5d26a775c86.poster.avif?t=1778072269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/f8b0ed7107784442a5ecd5d26a775c86.webm?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/f8b0ed7107784442a5ecd5d26a775c86.mp4?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw them into the chaos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes chaos happens but Mugi decides that she is not gonna be the one who fall. She can throw enemies to side-switch and use the chaos in her favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/f2fafd84191cd51a258be6ace5c59d90.poster.avif?t=1778072269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/f2fafd84191cd51a258be6ace5c59d90.webm?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/f2fafd84191cd51a258be6ace5c59d90.mp4?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combo = Damage²</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much damage Mugi deals depends entirely (mostly) on her combo (like in fighting games). Practice combo in training mode  and get that damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/7360862f0b8bed7bf9d19304d60dd211.poster.avif?t=1778072269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/7360862f0b8bed7bf9d19304d60dd211.webm?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/7360862f0b8bed7bf9d19304d60dd211.mp4?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See ya punching! (๑˃ᴗ˂)ﻭ</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/70138ba9225281f41f62a4f86fe21f29.avif?t=1778072269\" width=529 height=581 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/6e1b8fcc60b508de2c44d212f6b35d47.poster.avif?t=1778072269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/6e1b8fcc60b508de2c44d212f6b35d47.webm?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617970/extras/6e1b8fcc60b508de2c44d212f6b35d47.mp4?t=1778072269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MugiPunch</strong> is a 2D fast-paced <strong>beat 'em up</strong> where you keep punching <strong>enemies</strong> while precisely defending yourself. Mindlessly attacking <strong>them</strong> will only result in defeat. <strong>Observing enemy patterns, then parrying or dodging reactively, is</strong> crucial to stay alive. Unlock new abilities and build your own fighting style as Mugi fight<strong>s</strong> her way to get her lucky SSR drop back!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>